    "## Task 5 — Feature Engineering\\n",
    "\\n",
    "Build historical 48-hour risk features for each date.\\n",
    "\\n",
    "**Data leakage protection:** For each prediction date, only events\\n",
    "from the previous 48 hours (not including the current date) are used."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from src.feature_engineering import build_risk_features\\n",
    "\\n",
    "risk_features_df = build_risk_features(space_df)\\n",
    "\\n",
    "print('\\nFeature matrix shape:', risk_features_df.shape)\\n",
    "print('\\nSample features:')\\n",
    "risk_features_df.head(5)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Task 6 — Risk Scoring\\n",
    "\\n",
    "Calculate a 0–100 educational launch risk score using the formula:\\n",
    "\\n",
    "```\\n",
    "x_score     = min(xclass_flare_count × 40, 40)\\n",
    "m_score     = min(mclass_flare_count × 25, 25)\\n",
    "kp_score    = (max_kp_index / 9) × 20\\n",
    "trend_score = min(max((event_trend - 1) × 15, 0), 15)\\n",
    "total       = min(x_score + m_score + kp_score + trend_score, 100)\\n",
    "```\\n",
    "\\n",
    "Risk levels:\\n",
    "- LOW (0–20) → GO\\n",
    "- MODERATE (20–40) → CAUTION\\n",
    "- HIGH (40–60) → DELAY\\n",
    "- EXTREME (≥60) → NO-GO"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from src.risk_scoring import apply_risk_scoring\\n",
    "from src.persistence import get_recommendation \\n",
    "\\n",
    "scored_df = apply_risk_scoring(risk_features_df)\\n",
    "scored_df['recommendation'] = scored_df['risk_level'].apply(get_recommendation)\\n",
    "\\n",
    "print('\\nTop 10 highest-risk dates:')\\n",
    "print(scored_df.nlargest(10, 'risk_score')[['date', 'risk_score', 'risk_level', 'recommendation']])"
   ]
  },
  {
