   "source": [
    "## Task 7 — Train and Evaluate Decision Model\\n",
    "\\n",
    "Train a Random Forest classifier with a **time-based split**.\\n",
    "Data before 2025-01-01 is used for training; data on or after is used for testing.\\n",
    "The data is never shuffled to prevent look-ahead bias."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from src.model_training import train_model\\n",
